I unlock the door and walk into my apartment.
I drop my bag on the floor.
My legs are very tired.
But I am very happy.
I open the bag and take my sports clothes out.
I put the clothes into the washing machine.
Then I go into the bathroom.
I turn on the shower and take a hot shower.
The hot water is very nice.
I think about the evening and smile.
I really like to meet new people.
Kasper and Sara are very nice.
I also like to play badminton.
It is lovely to play my favorite sport again.
I want to do sports every week.
The winter outside does not feel so dark now.
Now I am clean and relaxed.
I go into the bedroom.
I am ready to sleep.
I close my eyes and look forward to next week.
